msgstr "Selle veebisaidi kasutamine"

#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-terms.php:234
msgid "What we offer"
msgstr "Mida me pakume"

#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-privacy.php:285
#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-terms.php:329
