# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-privacy.php:310
msgid "Complaints"
msgstr "Kaebused"

# machine translation
#: includes/features/class-seoprocookieconsent-privacy.php:311
msgid "If you are unhappy with how we handle your personal information, including our use of automated tools such as AI, please contact us first so we can try to put it right. Tell us what happened and what you would like us to do. We will acknowledge your complaint, look into it promptly and fairly, and tell you the outcome and what we will do about it."
msgstr "Kui olete rahulolematu sellega, kuidas me teie isikuandmeid käsitleme, sealhulgas automatiseeritud tööriistade, näiteks tehisintellekti kasutamisega, võtke palun esmalt meiega ühendust, et saaksime proovida olukorda parandada. Öelge, mis juhtus ja mida soovite, et me teeksime. Kinnitame teie kaebuse kättesaamist, uurime seda kiiresti ja õiglaselt ning teavitame teid tulemusest ja sellest, mida me selles osas teeme."

